{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-animations","title":"进阶动画与视觉编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/rendering/advanced-animations","wordCount":476,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"进阶动画与视觉编排\">进阶动画与视觉编排</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SwiftUI 的动画系统在 iOS 17/18 经历了范式升级：从早期的隐式/显式动画二分法，演进到 PhaseAnimator（相位动画）和 KeyframeAnimator（关键帧动画）两大声明式编排工具。加上 matchedGeometryEffect 的跨容器过渡和 CustomAnimation 协议的自定义插值器，开发者可以构建电影级视觉叙事而无需掉入 Core Animation 的命令式深渊。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 基础层&#10;        A[withAnimation] --&gt; B[隐式动画 .animation modifier]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 编排层&#10;        C[PhaseAnimator] --&gt; D[多阶段循环/触发]&#10;        E[KeyframeAnimator] --&gt; F[多属性独立时间线]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 过渡层&#10;        G[matchedGeometryEffect] --&gt; H[跨容器几何插值]&#10;        I[.transition] --&gt; J[进出场动画]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 自定义层&#10;        K[CustomAnimation Protocol] --&gt; L[自定义弹簧/阻尼曲线]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 基础层\n        A[withAnimation] --&gt; B[隐式动画 .animation modifier]\n    end\n    subgraph 编排层\n        C[PhaseAnimator] --&gt; D[多阶段循环/触发]\n        E[KeyframeAnimator] --&gt; F[多属性独立时间线]\n    end\n    subgraph 过渡层\n        G[matchedGeometryEffect] --&gt; H[跨容器几何插值]\n        I[.transition] --&gt; J[进出场动画]\n    end\n    subgraph 自定义层\n        K[CustomAnimation Protocol] --&gt; L[自定义弹簧/阻尼曲线]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动画类型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隐式动画</td>\n<td>单属性状态切换</td>\n<td><code>.animation(.spring, value:)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显式动画</td>\n<td>多属性同步变化</td>\n<td><code>withAnimation(.easeInOut) { }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PhaseAnimator</td>\n<td>多阶段循环（脉冲、加载指示器）</td>\n<td><code>PhaseAnimator([phases])</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KeyframeAnimator</td>\n<td>多属性各有独立时间线的复杂编排</td>\n<td><code>KeyframeAnimator(initialValue:)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>matchedGeometryEffect</td>\n<td>Hero 过渡、跨容器形变</td>\n<td><code>.matchedGeometryEffect(id:in:)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transaction</td>\n<td>局部覆盖动画参数</td>\n<td><code>withTransaction</code> / <code>.transaction</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"phaseanimator-相位动画\">PhaseAnimator 相位动画</h2><p>PhaseAnimator 将动画建模为有限状态机——定义若干相位（phase），SwiftUI 依次在相位间插值。非常适合循环动画：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct PulsingDot: View {&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        Circle()&#10;            .frame(width: 20, height: 20)&#10;            .phaseAnimator([false, true]) { content, phase in&#10;                content&#10;                    .scaleEffect(phase ? 1.6 : 1.0)&#10;                    .opacity(phase ? 0.3 : 1.0)&#10;            } animation: { phase in&#10;                phase ? .easeOut(duration: 0.8) : .easeIn(duration: 0.6)&#10;            }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PulsingDot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">phaseAnimator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) { content, phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                content</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scaleEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            } </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">easeOut</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">easeIn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>带触发器的非循环相位动画：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"enum SubmitPhase: CaseIterable {&#10;    case idle, pressing, success&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct SubmitButton: View {&#10;    @State private var trigger = false&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        Button(&quot;提交&quot;) { trigger.toggle() }&#10;            .phaseAnimator(SubmitPhase.allCases, trigger: trigger) { content, phase in&#10;                content&#10;                    .scaleEffect(phase == .pressing ? 0.9 : 1.0)&#10;                    .foregroundStyle(phase == .success ? .green : .blue)&#10;            } animation: { phase in&#10;                switch phase {&#10;                case .idle: .bouncy&#10;                case .pressing: .easeIn(duration: 0.1)&#10;                case .success: .spring(duration: 0.4, bounce: 0.3)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubmitPhase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CaseIterable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pressing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">success</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SubmitButton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @State</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"提交\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { trigger.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">toggle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">phaseAnimator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SubmitPhase.allCases, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: trigger) { content, phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                content</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scaleEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .pressing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">foregroundStyle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .green </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .blue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            } </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .idle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97